t;Lottie&gt; component once the data has been fetched.</span></span></div></div></div><div id="FhpLaf3BCN6ikdUPgeCkGA__21"><div class="Y6JuXb"><div data-hveid="CB4QAA" data-ved="2ahUKEwj9pLG249SRAxVeUaQEHQEwCQMQFSgAegQIHhAA"><div style="position:relative" class="tF2Cxc"><div class="yuRUbf"><div class="b8lM7"><span class="V9tjod" jsaction="trigger.mLt3mc"><a jsname="UWckNb" class="zReHs" href="https://www.remotion.dev/docs/lottie/remote#:~:text=In%20order%20to%20load%20a,the%20data%20has%20been%20fetched." data-ved="2ahUKEwj9pLG249SRAxVeUaQEHQEwCQMQFnoECB4QAw" ping="/url?sa=t&amp;source=web&amp;rct=j&amp;opi=89978449&amp;url=https://www.remotion.dev/docs/lottie/remote%23:~:text%3DIn%2520order%2520to%2520load%2520a,the%2520data%2520has%2520been%2520fetched.&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj9pLG249SRAxVeUaQEHQEwCQMQFnoECB4QAw&amp;authuser=2"><h3 class="LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md" id="_FhpLaf3BCN6ikdUPgeCkGA_46">Loading Lottie animations from a URL - Remotion</h3><br><div class="notranslate ESMNde HGLrXd ojE3Fb"><div class="q0vns"><span class="H9lube"><div class="eqA2re NjwKYd Vwoesf" aria-hidden="true"><img class="XNo5Ab" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABAAAAAQCAYAAAAf8/9hAAAAd0lEQVR4AWNwL/ChCNPGAO6Wz85ArEKaAQjN+4D4PxJejs8wVM2tXwTgGjHxPoIGABVFgBTjwyBL8BnQAVJECOMzYDkxBoDUUWrAPkoNUMFlQAMRmp3xhYEzHo3PQTYTTkiYGm+Cohd/QsJMTHkg14DYdMlMFGEAlR6FrtBgBYQAAAAASUVORK5CYII=" style="height:18px;width:18px" alt=""></div></span><div class="CA5RN"><div><span class="VuuXrf">Remotion</span></div><div class="byrV5b"><cite class="qLRx3b tjvcx GvPZzd cHaqb" role="text">https://www.remotion.dev<span class="ylgVCe ob9lvb" role="text"> › docs › lottie › remote</span></cite></div></div></div></div></a></span><div class="B6fmyf byrV5b Mg1HEd"><div class="HGLrXd ojE3Fb"><div class="q0vns"><span class="H9lube"><div class="eqA2re NjwKYd" style="height:18px;width:18px"></div></span><div class="CA5RN"><div><span class="VuuXrf">Remotion</span></div><div class="byrV5b"><cite class="qLRx3b tjvcx GvPZzd cHaq